# Dependencies / build toolchain — never commit
node_modules/
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Scratch / local artifacts
tools/.tmp/
*.log
.DS_Store

# NOTE: `agent/` and `skills/` are deliberately TRACKED so the overnight
# agent's STATUS.md / NOTES.md checkpoints are durable in git history
# (long-horizon protocol rule 4). They are private working briefs: the human
# strips them before any public publish. See agent/SPEC.md §2.
#
# NOTE: `lib/` is deliberately TRACKED (built output committed) so
# `dsh plugin add` works without a local TS/esbuild toolchain — same choice as
# the dsh-gpu-monitor-nvml blueprint.
